      "content": "# Preserve whisper.cpp JNI bridge entrypoints during R8/ProGuard shrinking\n-keep class ai.mangal.core.stt.WhisperJniBridge { *; }\n-keepclasseswithmembernames class ai.mangal.core.stt.** {\n    native <methods>;\n}\n"
